WEBVTT

00:00:10.551 --> 00:00:12.345
Ladies and gentlemen,

00:00:12.428 --> 00:00:14.805
please direct your attention
to the front of the cabin.

00:00:14.889 --> 00:00:17.016
For your safety,
please unbuckle your seat belts.

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:24.232
In the likely event we experience
a sudden drop in cabin pressure,

00:00:24.315 --> 00:00:25.900
oxygen will be provided.

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:30.196
Can I stow that for you, sir?

00:00:30.279 --> 00:00:31.531
All right. Thanks.

00:00:33.574 --> 00:00:35.868
Beverages. Snacks. Beverages.

00:00:35.952 --> 00:00:37.745
Beverages. Snacks.

00:00:37.828 --> 00:00:38.829
Beverages.

00:00:44.669 --> 00:00:46.754
-Coffee?
-That would be lovely.

00:00:53.135 --> 00:00:55.763
Mavis, please, you're torturing me.

00:00:55.846 --> 00:00:57.932
You know I hate surprises.

00:00:58.766 --> 00:01:00.351
This is a fun surprise.

00:01:00.434 --> 00:01:02.436
There are no fun surprises.

00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:04.230
Just tell me where we're going.

00:01:04.313 --> 00:01:05.815
Why are we on a plane?

00:01:05.898 --> 00:01:07.692
We can fly, you know.

00:01:07.775 --> 00:01:10.194
Back in my day, people took trains.

00:01:10.278 --> 00:01:11.696
Now, that's classy.

00:01:11.779 --> 00:01:14.782
Sure, Dad.
Forty hours in a closet-sized room

00:01:14.865 --> 00:01:17.660
with you and Uncle Bernie
and his smelly cigars,

00:01:17.743 --> 00:01:19.620
arguing who was more attractive,

00:01:19.704 --> 00:01:21.205
Cleopatra or Nefertiti.

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:23.249
Nefertiti.

00:01:23.332 --> 00:01:24.959
Okay, Dad, thank you.

00:01:25.209 --> 00:01:28.254
Mavis, this is such an amazing surprise!

00:01:28.337 --> 00:01:32.091
I can't wait to spend time
with the people I love most.

00:01:32.174 --> 00:01:36.095
But I beg of you,
tell me where we're going!

00:01:36.304 --> 00:01:39.974
Nope. I've taken care of everything,
so you don't need to worry.

00:01:40.057 --> 00:01:41.559
You've been so stressed out lately.

00:01:41.642 --> 00:01:44.061
It's time for you to relax.

00:01:52.653 --> 00:01:53.904
Now, isn't that better?

00:01:53.988 --> 00:01:55.281
Yes.

00:01:55.364 --> 00:01:56.782
So relaxed.

00:01:59.577 --> 00:02:01.996
I'm gonna go check on you-know-who.

00:02:02.079 --> 00:02:03.623
I'll be right back.

00:02:03.706 --> 00:02:05.958
I have to go to the bathroom.

00:02:06.042 --> 00:02:07.251
Did you see that?

00:02:07.335 --> 00:02:08.919
Dennis went to the bathroom!

00:02:09.754 --> 00:02:10.796
Okay.

00:02:14.592 --> 00:02:16.469
Hey, where are you?

00:02:21.390 --> 00:02:23.267
There you are, Tinkles.

00:02:23.351 --> 00:02:26.270
Don't worry,
we'd never leave you home alone.

00:02:26.812 --> 00:02:27.813
Okay, folks, you're free to move

00:02:27.897 --> 00:02:30.149
about the cabin,
as we have started our descent.

00:02:45.623 --> 00:02:48.417
So, any big plans
for the weekend there, Bill?

00:02:48.501 --> 00:02:49.877
You know, the usual.

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:51.629
Got to take the kids to soccer.

00:02:56.092 --> 00:02:57.218
Snacks. Beverages.

00:02:57.301 --> 00:02:59.345
Snacks. Beverages. Snacks.

00:03:12.149 --> 00:03:14.985
Ladies and gentlemen,
we've arrived at our destination,

00:03:15.069 --> 00:03:16.570
the Bermuda Triangle.

00:04:06.829 --> 00:04:09.165
Welcome to the Bermuda Triangle,

00:04:09.248 --> 00:04:13.043
where you'll embark on a monster cruise
of a lifetime.

00:04:17.465 --> 00:04:18.883
A cruise?

00:04:18.966 --> 00:04:20.176
Surprise!

00:04:20.801 --> 00:04:22.261
No, you... No.

00:04:22.344 --> 00:04:26.766
But it's just like a hotel on the water.

00:04:26.849 --> 00:04:31.187
I just figured you need a vacation
from running everyone else's vacation.

00:04:31.979 --> 00:04:34.064
You've barely been
out of the hotel since...

00:04:34.482 --> 00:04:36.150
Well, since Mom died.

00:04:37.193 --> 00:04:39.403
But this is a chance
to make new memories,

00:04:39.487 --> 00:04:40.780
with all of us.

00:04:40.863 --> 00:04:42.156
With Dennis.

00:04:43.115 --> 00:04:48.454
-Boat!
-Boat!

00:04:51.957 --> 00:04:54.794
Who made you such an amazing daughter?

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:56.086
You.

00:04:56.462 --> 00:04:57.463
That's right!

00:04:57.546 --> 00:04:59.131
What a father I am.

00:04:59.507 --> 00:05:02.009
Come on, Denisovich, let's get cruising!

00:05:49.974 --> 00:05:51.642
Okay. Smile.

00:05:53.394 --> 00:05:54.395
Thank you.

00:06:06.156 --> 00:06:07.908
"No pets allowed"?

00:06:19.670 --> 00:06:20.671
Perfect.

00:06:26.844 --> 00:06:28.512
Welcome aboard. How are you doing?

00:06:28.596 --> 00:06:30.014
-Dennis, come on.
-Nice to see you.

00:06:30.097 --> 00:06:31.432
Lovely shirt. Yes.

00:06:31.515 --> 00:06:33.809
Hello. Welcome aboard.

00:06:42.109 --> 00:06:43.485
This is Bob.

00:06:44.194 --> 00:06:45.404
Say hi, Bob.

00:06:45.696 --> 00:06:46.739
"Hi, Bob."

00:06:54.872 --> 00:06:56.832
Oh, my gosh, Griffin.

00:06:56.916 --> 00:06:58.542
I'm, like, so excited.

00:06:58.626 --> 00:07:00.961
This is, like, the nicest hotel
I've ever been to.

00:07:01.045 --> 00:07:02.212
Yeah!

00:07:02.421 --> 00:07:04.214
Man, this is amazing!

00:07:04.298 --> 00:07:05.716
There's so much to do!

00:07:05.799 --> 00:07:07.801
Olympic-size swimming pool...

00:07:09.011 --> 00:07:10.596
All-you-can-eat buffet...

00:07:14.141 --> 00:07:15.643
Full-service spa...

00:07:17.227 --> 00:07:19.480
I'm gonna get me a seaweed rewrap!

00:07:19.563 --> 00:07:22.149
It sounds like everything we can do

00:07:22.232 --> 00:07:23.943
at our hotel!

00:07:24.026 --> 00:07:26.487
Except on the water!

